@startuml
title LMS v1.1 — CR1 Class Extension and Student Submission Sequence
skinparam shadowing false

actor Lecturer
participant LecturerWindow
participant Database
database "SQLite" as DB
actor Student
participant StudentWindow

Lecturer -> LecturerWindow : choose assignment, Whole class,\ndeadline and reason
LecturerWindow -> Database : grantClassAssignmentExtension(...)
Database -> DB : BEGIN IMMEDIATE
Database -> DB : verify lecturer teaches assignment
Database -> DB : validate later, future deadline
Database -> DB : upsert assignment_class_extensions
Database -> DB : append system_audit event (scope=CLASS)
Database -> DB : COMMIT
Database --> LecturerWindow : success / error

Student -> StudentWindow : open or refresh assignments
StudentWindow -> Database : getStudentAssignments(studentId)
Database -> DB : join assignment, class extension,\nindividual extension and enrolment
Database -> Database : resolve maximum applicable deadline\nand extension label
Database --> StudentWindow : assignment rows with deadline and label
Student <-- StudentWindow : display class extension and revised deadline

Student -> StudentWindow : submit assignment
StudentWindow -> Database : submitAssignment(studentId, assignmentId, file)
Database -> DB : validate submission against effective deadline
Database --> StudentWindow : accept or reject
@enduml
